<h2 id="when" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">1. When this applies</h2>

User message includes **`pgpbp`** (whole token) **and** a pgbattest **run** (explicit or implicit).

**Parse (do this first; ask only if run cannot be mapped):**

| Piece | How it appears | Default if omitted |
|-------|----------------|--------------------|
| **Run** | `run_6.35`, `run 6.35`, `§6.35`, `6.35`, “the last pgbattest run”, “latest full-23” | Latest recorded full-catalog `pgbattest` on the scoreboard |
| **Scopes** | `scopes:[a, b]`, `scopes: a, b`, `for places:states …` | Every catalog scope that **failed Door A, B, or C** on that run |
| **Doors** | `doors:A,C`, “Door B only” | **A + B + C** (all fail kinds) |

If the run cannot be mapped to a scoreboard section + log path, ask **one** question: which `§6.xx`?

**Do not** implement product fixes under `pgpbp` alone.

