<h2 id="examples" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">8. Examples</h2>

```text
pgpbp run_6.35
pgpbp run_6.35 scopes:[places:countries, numbers:cardinals]
pgpbp §6.34 scopes: por-para:main
pgpbp 6.33 doors:C
pgpbp the last pgbattest run
```

Agent behavior:

- `pgpbp run_6.35` → all A/B/C fails on §6.35 (historically 3×A + 4×B + 0×C) → deep-dive each over_budget unit.
- `pgpbp run_6.35 scopes:[places:states]` → if verified, report **no failures in request**.
- `pgpbp §6.34 doors:C` → Door C only (e.g. por-para `#p1`/`#p2`).

